{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/schoonerjolly/items/26077/", "pk": 26077, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/schoonerjolly/", "pk": 8221, "shortname": "schoonerjolly", "name": "Schooner Jolly II Rover", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Florida Keys Sunset Sail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 0, "unicode": "Florida Keys Sunset Sail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Not available today", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 2000, "description": "*#*Come aboard the Schooner Jolly II Rover for an unforgettable sunset sailing experience - With a Hint of Piracy!- in the glistening waters of the Florida Keys.*\n\n#Rates\n\n**Adult (13+):**  $85\n**Child (4-12):**  $45\n**Infant (3 and younger):** Free\n\n#Duration \n\n2 Hours\n\n#About\n\nThis square-rigged, 80 foot topsail schooner, built in 1994, will transport you back in time with its tanbark colored sails and cannons. Enjoy an exciting, romantic, sailing experience while basking in the amazing views of a Florida sunset. \n\nSee Key West's gorgeous Historic Seaport, known locally as the Key West Bight. Once known for its shrimp boats, it is today both a beautiful sight and rich with history and waterfront culture. \n\n**During the sail, you will see:**\n\n- The renowned Key West sunset (and maybe even the \"green flash\" when the sun changes color for a moment if you're lucky)\n\n- Ocean wildlife, including schools of dolphins\n\n- Mallory Square, home of the Key West historical sculpture garden \n\n- Fort Zachary Taylor\n\n- The Navy Mole, a submarine base\n\n- Truman Annex, President Truman's \"Winter Whitehouse\" \n\n- \"Christmas Tree Island\"\n\n- Sunset Key, known for its multi-million dollar celebrity homes\n\n\n#Join us today for an experience of a lifetime that you will never forget!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, FL", "booking_notes": "#What Is Not Included?\n\nFood and beverages other than bottled water are not included on the sail. Please bring your own picnics and alcoholic or non-alcoholic beverages aboard in a small picnic basket sized cooler! We have ice chests aboard for you to use to store your snacks and drinks.\n\n\n\n#Meeting Location:\nHistoric Harbor, near Elizabeth and Greene Streets (Key West, FL)\n631 Greene St., Key West, FL 33040\n\n*Located at Conch Republic Seafood Restaurant*\n\n###Please arrive 15 minutes before departure time\n\n*Call and confirm departure time on the day of your trip - 305-304-2235*", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Starting at $45 | Most Popular! | Watch the sun go down from the water!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rQaQAkySDGkO6lDwe3IQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rQaQAkySDGkO6lDwe3IQ", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/schoonerjolly/items/26077/images/253473/", "pk": 253473, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jkb8Ow99SMKrclylzRcB", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jkb8Ow99SMKrclylzRcB", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri":